<title>GERMANY: Frankfurt dollar fix 1.6828 marks.</title>
<headline>Frankfurt dollar fix 1.6828 marks.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar was fixed at 1.6828 marks in Frankfurt on Wednesday, after 1.6698 marks on Tuesday. There was no Bundesbank intervention.</p>
</text>
